---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy | Duettino" description="Duettino records only on your PC and never connects to the network.">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>
    Duettino records only on your PC, writes files only to the folder you
    choose, never connects to the network and collects no telemetry.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your recordings stay in the folder you choose.</li>
    <li>
      The only other file it writes is a small settings file (your devices and
      folder) in <code>%AppData%\Duettino</code>.
    </li>
    <li>No account, no analytics, no telemetry.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    This website uses no cookies and no analytics. It remembers your light or
    dark theme choice in your browser, and nowhere else.
  </p>
  <p><a href="/">Back to Duettino</a></p>
</Layout>
